### 測試系統狀態
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 測試登入
POST {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "A001",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 錯誤密碼
POST {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "A001",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 不存在帳號
POST {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "NOT-EXIST",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 停用帳號不能登入
POST {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "A002",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 查看目前登入者：沒有攜帶 Token
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### 查看目前登入者：有攜帶 Token
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 測試管理者權限
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/admin-test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 未登入不能取得報表清單
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports

Accept: application/json
### 取得目前登入者可使用的報表
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 停用報表不能出現在清單
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### A002 一般使用者登入
POST {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "A002",
  "password": "123456"
}

### A002 取得報表清單
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Token 過期測試：重新登入
POST {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "A001",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Token 過期測試：剛取得時應成功
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{expireTestToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 分類停用後取得報表
GET {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 空白帳號密碼
POST {{ReportSystem.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeNo": "",
  "password": ""
}